{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、8月21日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が結成して１周年です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の今日に、私たちは初めて会いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔だって、年齢だって、名前だって知らない初めてみる可愛い女の子たち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は不安だらけでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何も知らない私が、本当にこの世界に飛び込んでいいのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも昔からずっと憧れてきたこの世界。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢を捨てて諦めることだけは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対したくなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから飛び込んできました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちーちゃんこと斎藤ちはるです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"硬かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初のお見たて会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔も、声も、トークも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がっちがちだった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何も飛び抜けた特技もなく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人前に立つのが苦手で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人見知りだったから上手く喋ることができなくて初めてのチャンスなのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにもできなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのときはまだニックネームがちーちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この名残から今でもメンバーは結構ちーちゃんって呼ぶ子が多いかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしいなあー(´･-･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今のちはるからは考えられない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかとみなみとのメイド部。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンベンションも頑張ったなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそのあとにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのイベントをやりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場がなくて披露する曲もなかった私たちにはここでしかアピールするところもなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力でからまわってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この頃から、ひとつ悩みがあって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラのまえ、大人のまえ、そしてファンの方のまえでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しちゃって全くいつもの素が出せない( ;  ; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初なんかメンバーにだって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの素が出せなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとはもっとはっちゃけたいのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人見知りって怖いわー(..)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素が出したくても出せないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャラが見つからなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が見つからなくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど今はひとつひとつのお仕事でもっと自分の素を出せるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり意識しないように頑張ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに作った自分でなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもの素を知ってほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっちゃけてる自分をみてほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振り返ってみて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつだけど、成長できてるかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなったかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分ではね、ちょっとは成長できたと思うんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１年前はただの中学生だったのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はこうして乃木坂46としてアイドルがやれてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなれました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして頑張れてるのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長できたのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族、友達、スタッフさん、メンバー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくださる皆さんのおかげなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、まだまだ満足してません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは今まで以上に成長しなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝、そして初心を忘れずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力を続けなきゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年、またこうして２周年ブログを書いてるときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年以上に成長できました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張れました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って胸張って言えるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"努力 感謝 笑顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちの初心の心。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"http